<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, backgroundColor: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif", flexDirection: 'column' }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', height: 120, paddingTop: 20, paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0B3C6E' }}>分步精修向导</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8A94A6' }}>第二章 · 精修与产出</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', height: 540 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 620, paddingLeft: 60, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Image src="assets/08_refine_wizard.png" style={{ width: 560, height: 380, objectFit: 'contain', border: '1px solid #C5D5E8', borderRadius: 8 }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A94A6', textAlign: 'center', marginTop: 8 }}>精修向导：按步骤放开参数，每步给出收敛反馈</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 600, paddingRight: 60, paddingTop: 30, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 20 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0B3C6E' }}>新手友好：把精修拆成可控的小步</Text>
      <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#E8F0F8', borderRadius: 10, padding: 18 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#333333', lineHeight: 1.6 }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0B3C6E' }}>分步放开：</span>第 1 步只精修标度因子与背景，收敛后再依次放开晶胞参数与峰形 (U, V, W)，避免参数一起放开导致发散。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#E8F0F8', borderRadius: 10, padding: 18 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#333333', lineHeight: 1.6 }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0B3C6E' }}>逐步反馈：</span>每一步实时显示 Rwp 变化与参数表，发现某步变差可立即回退上一步。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#2F8F4E', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>与精修页的「一键精修」是两条独立路径：想快用一键，想控过程用向导。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A94A6' }}>PolyXRD v0.15.0 使用手册</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A94A6' }}>09 / 14</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
